  "notes": "{繋|つな}げる means to connect, link, or tie things together.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{繋|つな}がる→繋がる：01963_tsunagaru⟧ (intransitive) - to be connected\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦インターネット→インターネット：04723_intaanetto⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{繋|つな}げる: to connect to the internet\n- WiFiに{繋|つな}げる: to connect to WiFi\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}げる: to join hands\n- ⟦{点|てん}→点：01553_ten⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦{点|てん}→点：01553_ten⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}げる: to connect the dots\n- ⟦{次|つぎ}→次：00819_tsugi⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{世代|せだい}→世代：05102_sedai⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{繋|つな}げる: to pass on to the next generation\n\nUSAGE:\n- ⟦{命|いのち}→命：02371_inochi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}げる: to sustain life\n- ⟦{関係|かんけい}→関係：01298_kankei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}げる: to maintain a relationship\n- ⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}げる: to continue/extend a conversation\nThe kanji {繋|つな} can also be written as {繫|つな} (variant form).",
